    {
      "documentId": "74ef287e-7d95-42b1-a7de-878aa7f6dfdd",
      "value": "In works such as La Nativité du Seigneur (1935) and Quatre études de rythme (1949–50), he simultaneously employs motifs with lengths given by different prime numbers to create unpredictable rhythms: the primes 41, 43, 47 and 53 appear in the third étude, \"Neumes rythmiques\".",
